`AdminMenuController` · `AdminMenuService`/`AdminMenuServiceImpl` · `AdminMenuMapper` · `AdminMenuEntity` · `AdminMenu*Dto`；树组装在 ServiceImpl；禁止 `admin.menu.processor.*`。

